  "description": "PROFINET IO 从站协议栈 C# SDK —— 把 Windows 主机变为 PROFINET IO 从站设备，受主站系统（如西门子 PLC）控制：RT Class 1 实时周期 · DCP 设备发现/命名/地址分配 · 过程数据 IO · 报警 + 诊断 + I&M 记录 · GSDML 导入 TIA V15+ · 搭配 DarraRT 实时内核驱动 · Windows x64 · 6 语言 SDK（同一 Core 内核） · profinet.darra.xyz · C# SDK for the Darra PROFINET IO device stack — turn a Windows host into a PROFINET IO device under the control of a master system (e.g. a Siemens PLC): RT Class 1 cyclic communication, DCP device discovery/naming/addressing, process-data IO, alarms, diagnostics and I&M records, GSDML import for TIA V15+; real-time frame timing with the DarraRT kernel driver; Windows x64; six-language SDKs on the same core.",
